## Summary
A 31-second aerial drone clip of a coastal highway at golden hour, moving from a wide
establishing shot to a slow push-in over traffic, ending on a static framing of the sun
touching the horizon. Clean, stabilized 4K footage well suited as b-roll for travel,
automotive, or lifestyle edits.

## Segments
[00:00.0-00:05.2] Wide aerial establishing shot: a two-lane coastal highway curves along
cliffs at golden hour. Four cars visible, ocean on the left, warm orange light from the
right. Slow forward drone movement, horizon level.
[00:05.2-00:12.8] The drone pushes in and descends toward the highway. A white SUV
becomes the focal subject, headlights on. Long shadows stretch across the asphalt;
lens flare enters top-right at 00:09.
[00:12.8-00:21.4] Tracking shot alongside the white SUV at road height, ocean waves
breaking against rocks below the guardrail. Camera speed matches the vehicle; smooth,
no shake. Light shifts warmer as the sun drops.
[00:21.4-00:31.5] The drone rises and rotates left to face the ocean, losing the road
from frame. Static final framing: the sun half-set on the horizon, sky gradient from
deep orange to violet. Slow fade to black over the final second.

